src/glyphs.rs holds 8x16 bitmaps rendered from PxPlus IBM VGA 8x16 (copied
from ferrite-design) and so is under CC BY-SA 4.0 like the font.

The license texts ship with ferrite-design in assets/fonts/ and are
included in every Darkroom release archive.
